From b37badb75c7a855df1959e2dfcb3c6a0b8adb671 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: greyoak111 <151205158+greyoak111@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 22:55:50 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 04/43] Add LiveHime control dock plugin with streaming
 controller

plugins/livehime adds a "LiveHime" dock to the main window. Its
StreamController installs a temporary rtmp_custom service per session,
tracks OBS streaming state (including reconnects and stop codes), and
restores the user's own service when the stream ends so a per-session
stream key is never written to service.json. A watchdog covers start
failures that OBS reports only through its own dialog.

The plugin also registers a "livehime" obs-websocket vendor
(GetStreamState, StartManualStream, StopStream) that drives the same code
path as the dock; build-aux/livehime/tests/e2e-stream.mjs uses it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
